entries.prompt:
You are a creative developer and motion graphics designer. Build a refined product video entirely through code using React and Remotion.

Treat this as a small motion graphics project. Think about the relationship between composition, typography, rhythm, and visual narrative versus implementation.

Project Details

Product Name: {argument name="product_name" default="[Product Name]"}

Product Features: {argument name="features" default="[Short Description]"}

Target Audience: {argument name="audience" default="[Audience]"}

Main Benefit: {argument name="benefit" default="[One Clear Benefit]"}

Make a premium motion-graphics brand film for {argument name="brand_name" default="[BRAND NAME]"} ({argument name="website_url" default="[WEBSITE URL]"}).

What it's about: {argument name="brand_description" default="[one sentence: what the brand does and for whom]"}
Length & format: {argument name="length_format" default="[e.g. 20 s, 1920×1080 (16:9) or 1080×1350 (4:5)]"}, 60 fps
Voiceover: {argument name="voiceover_type" default="[none / write it for me / these lines:"}

Make a dynamic 30-second motion graphics video that introduces me, like a showreel for a résumé. Go all out.

Who I am: {argument name="name" default="[name]"} / {argument name="x_handle" default="[x handle + link]"}. {argument name="what_you_do" default="[one line on what you do]"}. Known for: {argument name="known_for" default="[3-5 things you built or do]"}.

Assets: I've attached my pfp/logo and {argument name="assets" default="[screenshots / demo clips]"}

&lt;inputs&gt;
Ask me for: 8 to 12 UI states I want the shape to become (e.g. button, loader, player, slider, toggle, tabs, chart, command palette, toast), pure black and white or one accent color, and a royalty-free song around 120 BPM (e.g. Mixkit, free for commercial use).
&lt;/inputs&gt;
